step	1	1	The trials
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Brundt the Chieftain</col> told me that to become a member of the Fremennik I must earn the votes of seven of the twelve members of the <col=800000>council</col>.</col>
line	<col=000080>Each council member will vote for me if I pass their trial:</col>
line	<col=800000>Manni the Reveller - the drinking contest</col>
line	<col=800000>Olaf the Bard - a performance in the longhall</col>
line	<col=800000>Sigli the Huntsman - hunting the Draugen</col>
line	<col=800000>Sigmund the Merchant - a rare exotic flower</col>
line	<col=800000>Swensen the Navigator - the maze beneath his house</col>
line	<col=800000>Peer the Seer - the puzzle in his house</col>
line	<col=800000>Thorvald the Warrior - a fight with Koschei</col>
line	<col=000080>Once I have seven votes I should return to <col=800000>Brundt</col> in the longhall.</col>
done	<str>I passed the trials of seven members of the council of Rellekka, and they voted to accept me into their clan.</str>
done	<str>Brundt the Chieftain welcomed me as a Fremennik, and I was given a new Fremennik name.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
